      "Deal with the bedding and laundry the way you agreed with the owner. Make sure the pets have enough food and medication until the owner arrives back.",
      "Leave a note with anything they need to know, such as deliveries, changes in pet behavior, or household problems. Return all keys, remotes and vehicle items.",
      "Little touches get remembered. Owners have written about coming home to a washed car, freshly washed linen, a raked garden, and a welcome home bottle of wine. One came home to a casserole, fruit and salad ingredients in the fridge. None of it is required, but it's a lovely way to finish a sit.",
